WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.880
When I was a kid,
there was this strange old woman.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.640
People started to saying
she was a witch.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.960
If you knocked on her door, 
she would come and get you.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.500
*Sound knocking 
the door three times*

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.940
Hi, Chloe.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:34.640
I know that your recent relationship with 
your daughter hasn't been easy.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.320
She believes that, witches are 
conspiring to feed her to a demon.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.500
ONE KNOCK
WAKES HER

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:45.520
Be careful, Jess. 
There's a darkness around her.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.200
Did you do this?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.360
Chloe?

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.910
Who are you?

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.389
She opens a doorway between hell, 
so she can devour the innocent.

00:01:07.389 --> 00:01:09.620
She's coming for me next.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:12.380
Run.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.020
Jess?

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.880
Nothing is gonna happen to you.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.200
Open the door!!!

